    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c4fc6087_5b087e65",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000262
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T23:26:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Chromium project generally prefers ingesting header files via Git dependencies where possible. Chromium itself already takes a dependency on [DirectX](https://github.com/microsoft/DirectX-Headers). Unless there is a good reason not to, we should follow that lead in Dawn. See [third_party/microsoft_dxheaders](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/microsoft_dxheaders/) for the Chromium dependency. \n\nBinaries, of course, will need to be sourced from the NuGet package at nuget.org.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7fc0fa69_b0efd602",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-30T14:35:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dawn also has a `third_party/directx-headers` folder.",
      "parentUuid": "c4fc6087_5b087e65",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "60c8227d_c8578161",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-01T12:22:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "However, this one is pinned at an early commit for DXC to compile, so we may have a problem here.",
      "parentUuid": "7fc0fa69_b0efd602",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d1b472eb_cce55289",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-01T12:23:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, let me rephrase since this has changed recently, the version of `third_party/directx-headers` we use is determined by the version DXC wants to use, which is an earlier revision.",
      "parentUuid": "60c8227d_c8578161",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a5bba450_ee1b975c",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000262
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-01T16:13:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Stable DirectX APIs stay unchanged in Preview branches of the Github repository. So long as the early version of DXC we track uses stable APIs, we should be good. \n\nBeta testing LinAlg in Dawn requires that we move to top-of-tree DXC.",
      "parentUuid": "d1b472eb_cce55289",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6eeb2b52_f1311bfb",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-01T17:32:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "DXC is always ToT. It\u0027s DirectX-Headers that isn\u0027t (last I checked).",
      "parentUuid": "a5bba450_ee1b975c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d406698b_4dda410b",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 4024649
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-07T08:15:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The current d3d12.h in the existing DirectX-Headers does not expose the ID3D12SDKConfiguration1 interface at all, so we cannot use it to configure the Agility SDK.\nI update DirectX-Headers to the preview branch to fully support Agility SDK. However, I’m not sure whether this version upgrade will introduce impacts on other components.",
      "parentUuid": "6eeb2b52_f1311bfb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "de636c66_279dcb6e",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 156,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-14T15:43:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Resolving this as we won\u0027t be using DirectX-Headers.",
      "parentUuid": "d406698b_4dda410b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 156,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c0fd19bf_aca6a84a",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/AgilitySDK.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 58,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000262
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T23:26:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To keep things simple, we should standardize on using t`ID3D12SDKConfiguration1::CreateDeviceFactory` as the only solution to use the agility SDK instead of these constants. As you pointed out in a comment elsewhere, these need to be in the main executable to be useful.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "476dab0e_a528b90a",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/AgilitySDK.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 58,
      "author": {
        "id": 4024649
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-07T08:15:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Acknowledged",
      "parentUuid": "c0fd19bf_aca6a84a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b889b75f_d35fab9e",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/AgilitySDK.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 72,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000262
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T23:26:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code is unreliable. \n\nPer the documentation for [GetModuleHandleW](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/libloaderapi/nf-libloaderapi-getmodulehandlew) if you call it with just the name of the DLL and multiple DLLs with the same name but different paths are loaded, it is undefined which one gets returned. \n\nA better approach is to QI `ID3D12Device` for `ID3D12DeviceConfiguration` and call `GetDesc` to determine the SDK version.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "16f76dbd7c5b1fd4f25e6dd110c5572e42cf0f2e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
