      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T23:26:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is true that `SetSDKVersion` can only be called in developer mode but `ID3D12SDKConfiguration1::CreateDeviceFactory` can be called always. See [D3D12 Independent Devices](https://microsoft.github.io/DirectX-Specs/d3d/IndependentDevices.html). \n\nPrefer to use this method of ingestion instead of the __declspec(dllexport) constants.",
      "range": {
