      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your helpful advice! I\u0027ve updated the code as suggested.\nHowever, I found that loading Agility SDK DLLs from the local D3D12 directory still requires Developer Mode, even with CreateDeviceFactory.",
      "parentUuid": "6c4b47ad_879a9657",
