      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T23:26:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of a #define, I think Dawn should always build with the Agility SDK headers, even experimental ones, sourced from the Github repository. Runtime toggles should determine which features to enable at runtime with reasonable defaults for stable releases. Fewer build permutations for the build labs to build and test this way.",
