      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T00:35:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even if we pull the header from the NuGet package via CIPD, I still think we should avoid #defines. \n\nInstead, I think Dawn should _always_ compile with Agility SDK headers. Whether the Agility SDK is actually used should be governed by a Dawn toggle that\u0027s enabled by default. A toggle will make it easier to troubleshoot bugs.",
      "parentUuid": "782e1738_13418e15",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 33
      },
