      "writtenOn": "2026-05-13T07:54:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your updates! In some bots(e.g. win-dawn-rel\n), the Agility SDK seems not downloaded, so __has_include will fall back to the Windows SDK\u0027s \u003cd3d12.h\u003e.\nSince D3D_SHADER_MODEL_6_10 is only available in the Agility SDK, I will keep this #ifdef for now.",
